    "reason_for_pair_lut": "Current QS2CX_WH uses four arbitrary signed int4 palette entries, not necessarily uniformly spaced. A simple two-plane affine decomposition requires p0+p3=p1+p2. Pair LUT supports every such palette exactly.",
